{#
    A page of the public site in the theme layout it uses (`layout_template`). The blocks are rendered by their
    types, which escape everything they print, and `head` is HTML the modules listening to PublicPageRendering
    escaped, so both are printed as they are.
    Context: `layout_template`, `title`, `lead` (the summary, optional), `locale`, `site_name`, `content`, `head`,
    `updated_at` (UTC), and whatever the modules added (`main_menu`, `footer_menu`, `breadcrumbs` …).
#}
{% extends layout_template %}
{% block head %}{{ head|raw }}{% endblock %}
{% block content %}{{ content|raw }}{% endblock %}
